docs {
  # Admin APIs

  Admin-only endpoints for dashboard operations, audits, and back-office workflows.

  Every endpoint in this folder requires:

  ```txt
  Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
  ```

  The authenticated user must have:

  ```json
  {
    "role": "admin"
  }
  ```
}
